  "description": {
    "text": "Three-card Let's Go, Kanto! mini packs that General Mills put in specially marked cereal boxes from 15 January 2019, while stocks lasted, to promote Pokémon: Let's Go, Pikachu! and Let's Go, Eevee! Each pack held two common reprints and one sequin holofoil card found in no booster pack: Pikachu, Eevee, Charmander or Cubone. A fifth, Bulbasaur, came only in specially marked family-size boxes at Walmart.",
